{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa5.u07",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa5.u07",
  "version": 3,
  "content_hash": "632f5d1188fff3a3cbd52cd13403d00253a87ce5c3b9b617b3f1cff586b38a7b",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l01",
      "sha256": "5f0919e1f61d72dac6e878602d7ff2499f1ec3a30512e3638c4fd28f597d2ad9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l02",
      "sha256": "876fdfefa67979c094920dcc3b92bffe2056db272bad42feacc877984ecf95f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l03",
      "sha256": "0b32de2ad08763736c0a2630ec4838728cf07f009c746aa728ec790695eee1cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l04",
      "sha256": "cea454bc417c14c600067859b4010675588e98406e5fff4758d3ea1e1d80a4fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l05",
      "sha256": "ec8cfc80ae4a59922e231442d95b3ec6d1f31386bb3c287cf59bb5b27ae58735"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u07.l06",
      "sha256": "d4f4b17952db0fdc102a7f3f1aaf681b2a101a7fcccc9fcb0bef99f33e264e3e"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "0282f80fcb234fd49ec1b071d8d272ad4ffead4cf5254d4d370577863587c55b",
      "text": "Wah, seperti kunafa di Mesir. Kue ini bagian dari identitas Ramadan di sini, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0458659755e730dc4e65b85b89135bcd8fc8c735ca845976b63d0b5196568796",
      "text": "Bagi orang Mesir, koshary ___ makanan, tetapi juga kenangan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "065ceb0b3e9c85512ada17e915ee16a22020f47a983afc9423fc548ecd720b1a",
      "text": "pengaruh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ae01a6aa87175cdfa6153a32d3428171448f21c907c5929ef9459d5a8ce22dd",
      "text": "perkampungan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d5553e4cd7e4e185db86871b79c344d8f95f807871ee8bb1dfa85823132b15a",
      "text": "rempah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e65014e954a7f10b893298736fdd90414991c1089b316ff1956d76d66d5d7c5",
      "text": "Adab makan di rumah nenek sangat ketat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1795634ecbb0b8d0349314737a4cd90801f1909f280708c0f7b3bd86e071cc14",
      "text": "mencerminkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c54437f713d7bcc3e50f3f8b93fb050db80c45ef536f11347938d9b6f027f2c",
      "text": "pedagang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1f1ace95762d954776cdd29a34721efc5e4967a488391dd62a70d0995357c435",
      "text": "Ini soto Banjar. Coba cium, harum, kan?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "29a9c63b419c2b01ec25425c9280fefdabbec08d638464fd1dcedfdfedd752aa",
      "text": "kebiasaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2fdb435bafaaebda0071d80924f432fb07d0594a970c71575c3d09749a6f2bbb",
      "text": "Menarik sekali. Besok pagi kita ke pasar terapung, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "33cec91f322040bb1a7afcb334c1de057893a03ca23bcaee7ef4a79738c25852",
      "text": "Sama dengan adab makan di Mesir! Ternyata kita punya banyak persamaan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "39f7e06824ca1d3aecae0e95ea3aef32d716b04c236c18e3bfdf8b51b86a759b",
      "text": "pertemuan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3cf73882efa3f75b8ad607ea47e7d4176f0336bb4637a4c490bd07b3e45c8646",
      "text": "Ini kue bingka, kue khas Banjar. Biasanya dimakan waktu buka puasa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "41c8bba6ef908cddcd6ea2344d2f57c96a77c3e009fc9c28ed7972a6a2b9233c",
      "text": "Tidak apa-apa. Di Mesir, makan roti dengan tangan juga kebiasaan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "42a3b315dabc4244f63b7799fead85f904378b7846c60ce38e328564113759dd",
      "text": "Dulu orang menukar sayur dengan ikan, tanpa uang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "42b19b5ec6f9b54f80c07787ffe50440e9d982b8fbed9798097930da1e5a33f7",
      "text": "Bu, saya mau beli kue ini. Namanya apa?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "453cfb771537f93d56738422a2d403e0aa94964b0d6e609ffc87e9e1c52acb85",
      "text": "Tradisi pasar terapung sudah ada sejak zaman kesultanan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "49668f95fd06157e9166cfe1c0e3424c61105b077e6877fdca6514d1c34711b3",
      "text": "Soto ini bukan sekadar sup, tetapi juga sejarah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d892468cdcf55f229c0841e671f64f134f4591350b25f0964f2e0c6d3e5192c",
      "text": "Soto Banjar memakai kayu manis karena pengaruh pedagang Arab.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4de21c3833bb7dd185c3cc987c62aa2a3664a277b70c10cb5b807d806dd10989",
      "text": "Di Mesir dan Indonesia, makan bersama keluarga adalah kebiasaan yang indah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5314646b084df0d1efae0aceb1c08ce6f21176938bafa23d5dfcd63903dbcedf",
      "text": "Makanan ini lahir dari pertemuan banyak budaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "552a16f3f2680667a11ca348b9080cd3c78608538077ba06f064b89f758360b8",
      "text": "berkumpul",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "56aea676e64ba9c7b403bca659624dca4e3d402997778059f82de4e1c418925a",
      "text": "Saya suka soto Banjar karena ada kayu manisnya, seperti masakan Mesir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e61690cadf060dc5492be5916d6f9b908550dd49c6726df224ad1a06a85da50",
      "text": "Banjarmasin dulu pusat perdagangan di Kalimantan Selatan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "614f616165ef7bdd1edfca0474bb90f88b8707cfca58b3fab7f8da04fdbd3e1b",
      "text": "adab",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "623fb81d0394b270fc82a075e62ac07cbd764d0cb5ac1f3993104a19d0880c01",
      "text": "lahir",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ccc57855167f81613152377e9fe3b441c28d054c52cf0f4be154e3a499fe45f",
      "text": "perkebunan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "700aeb59c137ec8ebc2a29e7f9b31a568d174e240521b427e3aa3e9e0ebf5969",
      "text": "Betul. Makanan adalah bagian dari identitas kita.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70ba8d03f6cbf02d1148b75dddb9dc3f8eb444045cc3ce4462ce7f857dd9b150",
      "text": "menukar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "742bc9b87ced1fc34cf50a03ff89ae5060fbe736971f658bed5c599cdbc8afe3",
      "text": "identitas",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7589e2b86229bc1ed8c74e72b5e06bd8fc33eff76e54f59ae045a30c90c15faa",
      "text": "Kenapa banyak perkampungan dibangun di atas air?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7ec49d31c1e8c3e486587392a356155b02fa45c034396dac51eac236675537a0",
      "text": "Sebagian besar, ya. Tradisi ini sudah ada sejak zaman Kesultanan Banjar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "83d6a0b51a0ac9d65386352f57ce3780983b6f48b1c1d6e0d1c49d55292b3629",
      "text": "kayu manis",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "85a5d46c828b18e3698c88cfb9202c43bc2264e8e93a99cbf2bec7b44a940b05",
      "text": "Cara memakai rempahnya dipengaruhi oleh pedagang Arab dan India.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8bd0cc4d0da84efb435a822af1922d0254e633cb6f8deb8a474bb849399faddc",
      "text": "Perdagangan dan perkebunan membuat kota ini kaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8bd97a9f64e64c1fa5d9d23a86365009f7da5032f9882169051a30b6e381e33a",
      "text": "Petani itu ___ beras dengan ikan dari nelayan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8eddb137ee04b63365d50b8dcc61028a87b8c3da6cea0f7f4e8e4c0b8166844e",
      "text": "bukan sekadar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8fac2769a7136a301bd8f07a926c753ba71853891f61e724d0170d9ef68aadd9",
      "text": "Wah, ada kayu manis! Rasanya seperti di rumah nenek saya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "914dd2090af702b60f2c79fb75522bfe68b13c2e978a1117e1596d40a93c44bf",
      "text": "Mohamed, makanan apa yang paling mencerminkan Mesir?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9668b708bc28616a352157b09eed67fa5ec330a3cac487c92d7cf7d09cef6678",
      "text": "bersama",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "987ba2ae6b6e4d8c8d7bf6eef46326cf5c58c7022f8c70c60138c5e423334713",
      "text": "tradisi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "98f0e4bf487a7a349dccd34142eb8c3d0b0bd9432fa58a190b0e280beaec7d02",
      "text": "Selamat datang di Banjarmasin, kota seribu sungai!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9c375dbeed842fede7b8c028f0b3a3d33c144f9c3c3bbb4a47eb9f2ac8949567",
      "text": "Makan dengan tangan kiri dianggap tidak sopan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9e75358f63df8898a0a541b2437515d50b6684c049d557ca3286879cb07ed2ae",
      "text": "perumahan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "adc2d521885c2ef76f09a30028cdc6362a880dd7e208b85688dc29770430b375",
      "text": "Biasanya, para pedagang sudah berkumpul sebelum subuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b438f7832e70db022435a515b128d2adf123e6c2b46c4369d3355ea324636df8",
      "text": "perahu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b7a7d8b34ce8e2588cce93d2c48558d9d30d9e283e8b46a70b28a128442bfbe6",
      "text": "Pagi-pagi, perahu kecil berkumpul di tengah sungai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc7b852be270f0ab14933586d645e150c1601f0e91938f8a8550a66f454156b0",
      "text": "Mungkin karena pengaruh pedagang Arab dulu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "be0615a6bcfc3f7d6834e2f561d6b02bbe1cdd1c1ca00e2bbd51c9ec5d311c07",
      "text": "Supnya harum karena ada kayu manis dan cengkih.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c1e8533fa0406ef5cf96e638069095baa52f7bdb445c053c053930ec5d6413e1",
      "text": "Adab makan di Mesir dan Indonesia punya banyak persamaan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c386b1427db95be0627b67c7afc19055de50f1df726f71847031180b6c2a1e81",
      "text": "Masya Allah, banyak sekali perahu! Semua penjualnya ibu-ibu?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c9aeb028d41f1838245e984b9566bb44c75df9ce8eff5f840c94b712d195c7b9",
      "text": "Karena dulu semua perdagangan lewat sungai. Pasar pun ada di atas perahu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cbac43258129d7e80d945e2d7bfe2e9742612ba8f8c0bdbcd79d4215d64b6c6c",
      "text": "Sudah menjadi kebiasaan orang Banjar makan bersama di lantai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd03b279f3171ac8e6e7a4442cbc52c1e729fdc6e048bcf3f0b5debede5d2d5d",
      "text": "dianggap",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d3da8179e6b37c3846c90efcbfdcf6ab971f31b05f7e1952cbee2b3ec06f2f45",
      "text": "terapung",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d82d97712e7418f17cf2769d5e66047a5e2013584c905f0b29d9d0c03ad8e184",
      "text": "Silakan, Mohamed. Di sini kami biasa makan dengan tangan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dac3e547951656df2198b4c13c73d8ab869eb62526182199984391c8047f2e4e",
      "text": "Mungkin koshary. Isinya nasi, makaroni, dan lentil. Lahir dari pertemuan banyak budaya juga.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 92,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "df66a80cffa0fe44a89ab343f4be875edc95369f27a3f3ba765fb6c4d8200d52",
      "text": "Seperti soto Banjar! Jadi makanan bukan sekadar makanan, ya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e04000918c4497bf52ff6e479e26fd82f0d5b8e3bd4edde6609c611a59106ae7",
      "text": "Keluarga kami selalu makan bersama setiap malam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e0e6b79b561b459f138142adb5e107a6fb1413de7cfc7abd02ecd3052401e881",
      "text": "perdagangan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e3c88e851be34a5f82599c8c3f35fd29cb58091176f92e6df202c3117e995d9d",
      "text": "Apakah orang masih menukar barang?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e6ef731c5098fc135305d196b3127465605ebc565e4057acc28116b2cd1c3dbb",
      "text": "Pedagang Arab membawa resep baru ke Banjarmasin.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eb879df6845cd80aa93138e1fbece1dabfc1286a028bf837bd56b2d97521deb6",
      "text": "Tradisi pasar terapung penting karena menyatukan warga sungai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ed0fd4d3808580837de6635c70408a2e665583234450e0150edd67f4a4c05008",
      "text": "Jadi resep ini sudah jalan jauh, dari Timur Tengah sampai ke sini.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee258207ad46ba73b8e352cfdf95ac85148c07cd23b8de40a9214db7ca847948",
      "text": "harum",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee32212fab256e5b2131cc597cbd3b843ddf11895c85632f3d202d1f79b1b988",
      "text": "Kadang-kadang. Kebanyakan pakai uang, tetapi semangat berkumpulnya tetap sama.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f1007090464e4bdbaea71ab6125d237901b58018963512d3cb6b826f8a22d241",
      "text": "Tetapi pakai tangan kanan, ya. Tangan kiri dianggap tidak sopan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f19ad1dfa46fcd4bd0d8c04f17e56c3b0a694e8e9054e584e5d647ecc9852aa4",
      "text": "Kue ini lahir di Banjarmasin dan menjadi bagian dari identitas kota.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
